        "content_block_MxbrVy": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Kirtan_-_Devotional_Music.png",
            "title": "Kirtan - Devotional Music",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>You’ll enjoy uplifting kirtan (call-and-response music) led by our talented musicians, with lyrics displayed on-screen so you can sing along with us. Singing together is a moment for us all to let go of distractions and focus on God together. There is immense energy and power when we gather together and sing heartfelt songs that honor God for who He is and what He’s done, through the ages and in our lives. <\/p>",
            "content_align": "items-start"
          }
        },
        "content_block_RbgVhW": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/A_Powerful_Message.png",
            "title": "A Powerful Message",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>Every month features a new and relevant theme, explored through inspiring 30-minute talks by our senior teachers. These lectures offer practical insights and tools to deepen your connection with God and improve your daily life. The lectures are grounded, authentic and inspired by the incomparable wisdom of Paramahamsa Vishwananda and the Vedic tradition.<\/p>",
            "content_align": "items-start"
          }
        },
        "content_block_GgJ49k": {
          "type": "content_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/A_Loving_Community.png",
            "title": "A Loving Community",
            "title_tag": "h3",
            "title_font_style": "h5",
            "description": "<p>Our weekly program is here to help keep your inner flame alive, supporting you in becoming the best version of yourself. By coming together in these special moments, we form a powerful, positive force to inspire others and lead with kindness—whether in family life, at work, or in all aspects of life. So please, invite your family and friends to join us at Bhakti Sundays and experience the love of God!<\/p>",
            "content_align": "items-start"
          }
        }
